      {% comment %} FAQ migrated from ID19 {% endcomment %}
      <section class="ems-faq" id="faq" aria-label="Često postavljana pitanja">
        <div class="ems-faq__inner">
          <h2 class="ems-faq__title stitle2 reveal-on-scroll">Često postavljana pitanja</h2>

          <div class="ems-faq__list" data-sp-faq-list>
            <article class="ems-faq__item reveal-on-scroll">
              <button
                class="ems-faq__question"
                type="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="ems-faq-answer-1"
                data-sp-faq-trigger
              >
                <span class="ems-faq__question-text stexts2">Pružaju li potporu kod bolnog plantarnog fascitisa?</span>
                <span class="ems-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <picture class="ems-faq__plus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq___mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_6f3aad91-5c5c-415e-b12e-f306fa459bb9.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                  <picture class="ems-faq__minus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_-_mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_1420ce0d-38ed-4e3a-b366-6b236f871c44.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                </span>
              </button>
              <div class="ems-faq__answer" id="ems-faq-answer-1">
                <div class="ems-faq__answer-inner stext2">Oblikovana potpora svodu smanjuje napetost duž plantarne fascije, dok amortizacija pete ublažava svaki doskok. Dosljedna potpora može olakšati jutarnje šetnje i kretanje.</div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="ems-faq__item reveal-on-scroll">
              <button
                class="ems-faq__question"
                type="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="ems-faq-answer-2"
                data-sp-faq-trigger
              >
                <span class="ems-faq__question-text stexts2">Zašto je potpora svodu važna u ovoj cipeli?</span>
                <span class="ems-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <picture class="ems-faq__plus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq___mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_6f3aad91-5c5c-415e-b12e-f306fa459bb9.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                  <picture class="ems-faq__minus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_-_mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_1420ce0d-38ed-4e3a-b366-6b236f871c44.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                </span>
              </button>
              <div class="ems-faq__answer" id="ems-faq-answer-2">
                <div class="ems-faq__answer-inner stext2">Stabilna potpora svodu usmjerava stopalo prema zdravijem položaju i raspoređuje težinu preko široke površine. Time se smanjuje opterećenje ispod pete i srednjeg dijela stopala, a gležnju i koljenu pomaže da se prirodno kreću.</div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="ems-faq__item reveal-on-scroll">
              <button
                class="ems-faq__question"
                type="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="ems-faq-answer-3"
                data-sp-faq-trigger
              >
                <span class="ems-faq__question-text stexts2">Jesu li mekane ili čvrste?</span>
                <span class="ems-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <picture class="ems-faq__plus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq___mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_6f3aad91-5c5c-415e-b12e-f306fa459bb9.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                  <picture class="ems-faq__minus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_-_mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_1420ce0d-38ed-4e3a-b366-6b236f871c44.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                </span>
              </button>
              <div class="ems-faq__answer" id="ems-faq-answer-3">
                <div class="ems-faq__answer-inner stext2">Kombiniraju amortizaciju sa strukturom umjesto da se oslanjaju samo na mekoću. Uložak je udoban, dok potpora svodu i peti usmjerava položaj stopala i regulira pritisak pri hodanju.</div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="ems-faq__item reveal-on-scroll">
              <button
                class="ems-faq__question"
                type="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="ems-faq-answer-4"
                data-sp-faq-trigger
              >
                <span class="ems-faq__question-text stexts2">Mogu li ih nositi tijekom bolnog pogoršanja?</span>
                <span class="ems-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <picture class="ems-faq__plus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq___mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_6f3aad91-5c5c-415e-b12e-f306fa459bb9.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                  <picture class="ems-faq__minus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_-_mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_1420ce0d-38ed-4e3a-b366-6b236f871c44.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                </span>
              </button>
              <div class="ems-faq__answer" id="ems-faq-answer-4">
                <div class="ems-faq__answer-inner stext2">Obuća koja pruža potporu može pomoći kada se simptomi pojačaju jer hodanje bosih nogu i ravne cipele dodatno opterećuju stopala. Počnite s kratkim razdobljima nošenja i potražite stručni savjet ako je bol jaka, iznenadna ili se s vremenom pogoršava.</div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="ems-faq__item reveal-on-scroll">
              <button
                class="ems-faq__question"
                type="button"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="ems-faq-answer-5"
                data-sp-faq-trigger
              >
                <span class="ems-faq__question-text stexts2">Kada bi se bol u plantarnoj fasciji trebala ublažiti?</span>
                <span class="ems-faq__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <picture class="ems-faq__plus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq___mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_6f3aad91-5c5c-415e-b12e-f306fa459bb9.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                  <picture class="ems-faq__minus"><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_-_mb.svg?v=1791962092"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_faq_1420ce0d-38ed-4e3a-b366-6b236f871c44.svg?v=1791962092" alt="" width="24" height="24" loading="lazy"></picture>
                </span>
              </button>
              <div class="ems-faq__answer" id="ems-faq-answer-5">
                <div class="ems-faq__answer-inner stext2">Neki ljudi odmah primijete bolju potporu, dok nadraženom tkivu može trebati više vremena. Nosite cipele redovito, postupno povećavajte vrijeme nošenja i imajte na umu da oporavak ovisi o težini tegoba i aktivnosti tijekom vremena.</div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
                
          <a class="common-button ems-faq__cta reveal-on-scroll" href="#shopping">KUPUJTE ODMAH<img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0688/0460/8043/files/ID-20-YH107740_arrow-icon1.svg?v=1791874256" alt="" width="41" height="41" loading="lazy"></a>
